76
00:03:29,740 --> 00:03:32,240
So it's not necessarily that
it means that it's pilot error.

77
00:03:32,240 --> 00:03:34,360
But what it's saying is that
there's nothing physically

78
00:03:34,360 --> 00:03:35,360
